---
// Hero della landing Duplex. Foto Ultrax 45 in placeholder finche' non arriva il file vero.
---

<section class="dx-hero" id="top">
  <div class="dx-hero__inner">
    <div class="dx-hero__copy">
      <h1 class="dx-hero__title">Ultrax 45 in noleggio operativo, da 72 euro al mese</h1>
      <p class="dx-hero__subtitle">Canone fisso, condizioni uguali in tutta Italia, trimestre di grazia per chi parte adesso</p>
      <p class="dx-hero__note">Disponibile anche per la gamma Duplex 340, 420, 620 e Escalator</p>
      <a href="#simulatore" class="dx-hero__cta">Calcola il tuo canone</a>
    </div>
    <div class="dx-hero__media">
      <img
        src="/images/duplex/ultrax-45-hero.jpg"
        alt="Ultrax 45 in posa frontale, illuminazione viola, marchio ultra45 visibile"
        class="dx-hero__img"
        width="1702"
        height="2168"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dx-hero {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dx-border, #D9D7D2);
  }
  .dx-hero__inner {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 20px 56px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .dx-hero__title {
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 46px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: var(--dx-blue, #1B3A57);
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
  }
  .dx-hero__subtitle {
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--dx-text, #1A1A1A);
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .dx-hero__note {
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #5a5a5a;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
  }
  .dx-hero__cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--dx-orange, #E66A2C);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 14px 26px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background-color 120ms ease;
  }
  .dx-hero__cta:hover { background: #c95820; }
  .dx-hero__img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 520px;
    object-fit: contain;
    background: #0e0a18;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: block;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .dx-hero__img { max-height: 600px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .dx-hero__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      padding: 72px 32px 80px;
      gap: 48px;
    }
  }
</style>
